                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">12 CONTROLS
1 Form: 0 arch / 0.5 oculus / 1 split
2 Main levels: height + opening rhythm
3 Void ratio: opening size in every form
4 Satellite count: 0-8
5 Seed: repeatable pattern/positions
6 Island depth: tapered bases
7 Ring radius: distance + bridge length
8 Satellite size: footprint/height
9 Height variation: satellite z + slope
10 Bridge width: proportion
11 Detail: roots/orbs/waterfalls
12 Model scale: whole composition</item>
